===================================================================
TELEFORGE ATTRIBUTION & UPSTREAM COMPLIANCE
===================================================================
TeleForge is an unofficial, third-party client built on top of the
official Telegram MTProto 2.0 network protocols and GramJS.

Upstream Telegram Source:
- Telegram is a trademark of Telegram FZ-LLC / Telegram Messenger Inc.
- Telegram Android and Web source code are released under GNU GPL v2 or v3.
- GramJS is licensed under the MIT License.

TeleForge Modifications:
- TeleForge Brand Identity (Deep Red #8B1E22 + Warm Cream #FFF8EE)
- TeleForge Power Folders System with Real Cloud Filter Synchronization
- TeleForge Theme Studio with Live Preview & Contrast Compliance Checker
- TeleForge Power Tools (Custom Chat Styling, Quick Reactions Tray, Gestures)
- TeleForge Command Center Hub
- Enhanced MTProto dialog caching and inline thumbnail extraction

All rights reserved by their respective copyright holders.
